
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080b16">
<title>VHVR BOT | Dashboard</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#080b16;--panel:#12182b;--line:#293452;--blue:#6ba5ff;--purple:#ad83ff;--text:#f5f6ff;--muted:#9ba6c5}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top left,#252050,transparent 48%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;min-height:100vh}
main{max-width:800px;margin:auto;padding:22px 16px 110px}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:28px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
.logo{display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:15px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#568aff,#a16cff);font-size:25px;box-shadow:0 0 25px #775cff55}
h1{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0}
.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.status{font-size:11px;color:#69edbf;border:1px solid #286957;background:#10372e;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:20px}
.hero{padding:25px 20px;border:1px solid #454174;border-radius:23px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#24254b,#12182b);margin-bottom:25px}
.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#b7a5ff;font-weight:bold}
h2{font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:13px 0}
.gradient{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#75bdff,#c39aff);background-clip:text;color:transparent}
p{color:#b5bfdc;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}
button{cursor:pointer;font:inherit}
.primary,.secondary{border-radius:11px;padding:12px 15px;font-weight:bold}
.primary{border:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#578aff,#9765ed);color:white}
.secondary{border:1px solid #465071;background:#ffffff08;color:white}
.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:18px}
.section{font-size:17px;margin:27px 0 13px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
.card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#171e33,#101526);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;padding:16px;min-width:0}
.card .emoji{font-size:25px;margin-bottom:12px}
.label{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.value{font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:6px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:7px}
.page{display:none}.page.active{display:block}
.feature{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:18px}
.feature:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.feature-icon{background:#7567ff22;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;font-size:21px}
.feature h3{font-size:14px;margin:2px 0 5px}
.feature p{font-size:12px;margin:0}
.wide{grid-column:1/-1}
nav{position:fixed;bottom:12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:min(440px,calc(100% - 24px));display:flex;gap:5px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #394361;border-radius:18px;background:#111629f5;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0008;z-index:5}
nav button{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:11px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 3px;font-size:11px}
nav button span{display:block;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:3px}
nav button.active{background:#665bff30;color:#d0c9ff}
footer{text-align:center;color:#737e9f;font-size:11px;margin-top:28px}
#toast{display:none;position:fixed;z-index:9;bottom:95px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#252d46;border:1px solid #53648a;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 15px;width:max-content;max-width:90%;font-size:13px}
@media(min-width:600px){main{padding-top:35px}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.hero{padding:35px}.features{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header>
<div class="brand">
<div class="logo">⚡</div>
<div><h1>VHVR <span class="gradient">BOT</span></h1><div class="muted">FUTURE STARTS HERE</div></div>
</div>
<div class="status">● WEB ONLINE</div>
</header>

<section id="home" class="page active">
<div class="hero">
<div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO THE SYSTEM</div>
<h2>Dashboard <span class="gradient">Futuristik</span></h2>
<p>Selamat datang di pusat kontrol VHVR BOT. Jelajahi antarmuka digital modern dengan desain neon biru dan ungu.</p>
<div class="actions">
<button class="primary" onclick="showPage('features')">✦ Jelajahi fitur</button>
<button class="secondary" onclick="showPage('about')">Tentang VHVR</button>
</div>
</div>
<h2 class="section">Ringkasan sistem</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">🌐</div><div class="label">Website</div><div class="value" style="color:#69edbf">ONLINE</div><div class="note">Halaman berhasil dimuat</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">🤖</div><div class="label">Telegram Bot</div><div class="value">Belum diuji</div><div class="note">Perlu pengujian bot</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">📱</div><div class="label">Platform</div><div class="value">Telegram</div><div class="note">Siap dikembangkan</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">✨</div><div class="label">Antarmuka</div><div class="value">VHVR UI</div><div class="note">Dashboard interaktif</div></div>
</div>
<h2 class="section">Akses cepat</h2>
<div class="grid">
<button class="card" style="color:white;text-align:left" onclick="showPage('features')"><div class="emoji">🧩</div><b>Fitur</b><div class="note">Jelajahi menu dashboard</div></button>
<button class="card" style="color:white;text-align:left" onclick="showPage('about')"><div class="emoji">👾</div><b>Tentang bot</b><div class="note">Informasi proyek VHVR</div></button>
</div>
</section>

<section id="features" class="page">
<div class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE SYSTEM</div><h2 class="section">Fitur Dashboard</h2>
<div class="grid features">
<div class="card"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">⚡</div><div><h3>Desain futuristik</h3><p>Warna neon dan kartu modern.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">📲</div><div><h3>Ramah Android</h3><p>Menyesuaikan ukuran layar HP.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">🧭</div><div><h3>Navigasi interaktif</h3><p>Pindah menu tanpa memuat ulang.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">🔧</div><div><h3>Mudah dikembangkan</h3><p>HTML, CSS, dan JavaScript.</p></div></div></div>
</div>
<div class="card" style="margin-top:13px"><b>🔌 Status integrasi</b><p>Dashboard ini belum terhubung ke backend atau API Telegram. Integrasi dilakukan pada tahap berikutnya.</p><button class="secondary" onclick="showPage('about')">Informasi proyek</button></div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="page">
<div class="eyebrow">PROJECT INFORMATION</div><h2 class="section">Tentang VHVR BOT</h2>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">⚡</div><h2>VHVR BOT</h2>
<p>Dashboard web futuristik untuk proyek bot Telegram VHVR. Antarmuka ini dapat dikembangkan menjadi Telegram Mini App.</p>
<div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">🌐</div><div><h3>Hosting website</h3><p>GitHub Pages</p></div></div>
<div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">🤖</div><div><h3>Platform bot</h3><p>Telegram — konfigurasi terpisah diperlukan.</p></div></div>
<button class="primary" onclick="notice('Antarmuka VHVR BOT berjalan. Integrasi Telegram belum diatur.')">✓ Periksa antarmuka</button>
</div>
<div class="card" style="margin-top:13px"><b>🔐 Catatan keamanan</b><p>Jangan pernah memasukkan token rahasia bot Telegram ke dalam file HTML.</p></div>
</section>
<footer>VHVR BOT © 2026 · DIGITAL EXPERIENCE</footer>
</main>

<nav aria-label="Navigasi utama">
<button class="active" data-page="home" onclick="showPage('home')"><span>⌂</span>Beranda</button>
<button data-page="features" onclick="showPage('features')"><span>✧</span>Fitur</button>
<button data-page="about" onclick="showPage('about')"><span>◈</span>Tentang</button>
</nav>
<div id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

<script>
function showPage(id){
document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(p=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.id===id));
document.querySelectorAll('nav button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.page===id));
window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});
}
let toastTimer;
function notice(message){
const t=document.getElementById('toast');
t.textContent=message;t.style.display='block';
clearTimeout(toastTimer);
toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>t.style.display='none',3000);
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
